#%PAM-1.0
# The PAM service the caustics canvas's lock sidecar authenticates through
# (ledgers 0049, 0050; CAUSTICS_LOCK_PAM_SERVICE on caustics-canvas.service).
# password-auth rather than login: the same stack without pam_fprintd, so an
# unlock never waits out the 5 s fingerprint timeout with no prompt for it
# on screen (the lock takes fingerprints through fprintd itself). Only the
# auth phase runs: the lock neither opens a session nor checks the account.
auth       include      password-auth
